Meta{format:TOON_v2.1.0,project:Request-Website-v2.0,document:REQUEST_DESIGN,updated:2026-02-08}:

DesignPrompt{alpha_v2}:
- Build_Request_v2_landing_with_bold_editorial_hero
- Use_video_or_motion_backdrops_for_hero_and_full_screen_sections
- Prioritize_strong_typography_and_high_contrast_accent
- Emphasize_clarity_speed_actionability_of_requests

Pages{targets}:
- Home(page/home)
- Imprint
- Privacy_Policy

StyleGuide{v2}:
- Typography: Sora(body) + Manrope(headings)
- BaseSize: 16px, HeadingScale: 1.25
- Colors: Primary #E50051, Secondary #B0003A, Accent #FF4D7F
- Backgrounds: layered_gradients + subtle_noise_texture
- Radius: 16px default
- Spacing: section_padding M=5rem 2.5rem
- Motion: page_load_fade + section_stagger_on_scroll

Slices{usage}:
- Hero: full-viewport, video or gradient background, 2 CTAs
- FeaturesGrid: 3-6 cards, icon + short text
- FullScreenSection: background video, minimal overlay text
- CTABanner: strong CTA with contrast
- Footer: legal + social links

Assets{inputs}:
- Brand_logo
- Hero_video_loop(5-12s)
- Social_icons(SVG)
- OG_image(1200x630)

Notes{cms}:
- Use appearance_* fields per slice for background, text color, and spacing
- Keep copy tight, action-oriented, 2-3 sentences max per section
